<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκανδαλ-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>acrobat who performed on a trapeze</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάνδαλον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				847.5
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>), v.
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.328
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ον, τό</span>, <i>trap</i> or <i>snare</i> laid for an
			enemy, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				23.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				18.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				11.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>; prob. laid for animals, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				608.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκανδάνων</span>, gen. pl.): metaph., <i>stumbling-block,
				offence, scandal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				18.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				17.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάνδαλα ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκανδαλιστής</span>
			.</div>
